            "notes": "# Round 1\n\n## How?\n\nThis entire build is focused around **HEALING** until you use Coalescence. With  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) you want to focus entirely upon left clicking your allies.\n\nIn R1, you will need to right click as we lack  [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6).\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\nWe take  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) here as in the early game  [Destruction's Divide](item_cb7be5fa-0098-4a3c-bf62-efb3738a97e6) is not particularly strong. Once we get more   [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) we can get that.",
