            "notes": "# Round 2\n\n## How?\n\nUse Fade off cooldown and hold left click to permanently have healing up. With  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) we can spam heal orbs. Try to avoid using damage orb, as that provides no survival for you.\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\n [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) is the key to this entire build. Without it we can't spam  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d).",
